<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 133 0 R
/E (Python serves as the core programming language, while Streamlit powers the interactive web interface. Scikit-Learn enables TF-IDF vectorization and cosine similarity calculations for resume matching. spaCy handles NLP-based skill extraction from resumes and job descriptions. PyPDF2 extracts raw text from uploaded PDF resumes, and Pandas manages candidate data and report generation. Plotly delivers interactive visualizations and analytics dashboards, while CSV files provide lightweight candidate data storage and export functionality.)
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [7]
>>
